<article id="post-8238" class="post-8238 post type-post status-publish format-standard has-post-thumbnail hentry category-cse-issuer-stories category-cse-magazine tag-2021-issue-2 tag-4front-ventures-cseffnt tag-ayr-wellness-cseayr-a tag-cse-magazine tag-gage-growth-csegage tag-red-white-bloom-brands-cserwb tag-verano-holdings-csevrno">
	
	<a class="post-thumbnail" href="https://blog.thecse.com/canadian-securities-exchange-magazine-the-cannabis-issue-now-live/" aria-hidden="true">
	<img width="672" height="372" src="https://blog.thecse.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/09/CSE_2021-Issue-2_New-Issue_Blog-Header-672x372.png" class="attachment-post-thumbnail size-post-thumbnail wp-post-image" alt="Canadian Securities Exchange Magazine: The Cannabis Issue – Now Live!" decoding="async" loading="lazy" srcset="https://blog.thecse.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/09/CSE_2021-Issue-2_New-Issue_Blog-Header-672x372.png 672w, https://blog.thecse.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/09/CSE_2021-Issue-2_New-Issue_Blog-Header-1038x576.png 1038w" sizes="auto, (max-width: 672px) 100vw, 672px" data-attachment-id="8242" data-permalink="https://blog.thecse.com/canadian-securities-exchange-magazine-the-cannabis-issue-now-live/cse_2021-issue-2_new-issue_blog-header/" data-orig-file="https://blog.thecse.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/09/CSE_2021-Issue-2_New-Issue_Blog-Header.png" data-orig-size="1920,1080" data-comments-opened="0" data-image-title="CSE_2021 Issue 2_New Issue_Blog Header" data-image-description="" data-image-caption="" data-large-file="https://blog.thecse.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/09/CSE_2021-Issue-2_New-Issue_Blog-Header-1024x576.png" />	</a>

	
	<header class="entry-header">
				<div class="entry-meta">
			<span class="cat-links"><a href="https://blog.thecse.com/category/cse-issuer-stories/" rel="category tag">CSE Issuer Stories</a>, <a href="https://blog.thecse.com/category/cse-magazine/" rel="category tag">Magazine</a></span>
		</div>
		<h1 class="entry-title"><a href="https://blog.thecse.com/canadian-securities-exchange-magazine-the-cannabis-issue-now-live/" rel="bookmark">Canadian Securities Exchange Magazine: The Cannabis Issue – Now Live!</a></h1>
		<div class="entry-meta">
			<span class="entry-date"><a href="https://blog.thecse.com/canadian-securities-exchange-magazine-the-cannabis-issue-now-live/" rel="bookmark"><time class="entry-date" datetime="2021-09-09T14:07:33-04:00">September 9, 2021</time></a></span> <span class="byline"><span class="author vcard"><a class="url fn n" href="https://blog.thecse.com/author/administrator/" rel="author">CSE Blogger</a></span></span>		</div><!-- .entry-meta -->
	</header><!-- .entry-header -->

		<div class="entry-content">
		<p><span style="font-weight: 400;">Welcome to the inaugural issue of the </span><i><span style="font-weight: 400;">Canadian Securities Exchange Magazine</span></i><span style="font-weight: 400;"> (formerly </span><i><span style="font-weight: 400;">Public Entrepreneur</span></i><span style="font-weight: 400;"> magazine), your source for in-depth stories of entrepreneurs from a wealth of different industries.</span></p>
<p><span style="font-weight: 400;">As the Exchange for Entrepreneurs, we thrive on change. It is fitting, then, that we unveil an important change of our own to carry us into the future: the update of this publication&#8217;s name to </span><i><span style="font-weight: 400;">Canadian Securities Exchange Magazine</span></i><span style="font-weight: 400;">.</span></p>
<p><span style="font-weight: 400;">This new name for our magazine is a reflection that our company identity, and the trailblazing entrepreneurs whose stories are featured within these pages, are synonymous with innovation, agility, and evolution. These traits are particularly evident within the cannabis industry.</span></p>
<p><span style="font-weight: 400;">In this issue of </span><i><span style="font-weight: 400;">Canadian Securities Exchange Magazine</span></i><span style="font-weight: 400;">, we shine a spotlight on five CSE-listed cannabis companies who have set themselves apart in the space and continue to make change with a combination of strong branding and meticulous strategy. Plus, we provide an exclusive behind the scenes look at the Cannabis Investor Series. Read on to learn more about the opportunities and challenges ahead for the industry as global acceptance of cannabis continues to rise.</span></p>
<p><span style="font-weight: 400;">The CSE-listed companies featured in this issue include:</span></p>
<ul>
<li><span style="font-weight: 400;">Verano Holdings (</span><a href="https://thecse.com/en/listings/life-sciences/verano-holdings-corp-class-a-subordinate-voting-shares"><span style="font-weight: 400;">CSE:VRNO</span></a><span style="font-weight: 400;">)</span></li>
<li style="font-weight: 400;" aria-level="1"><span style="font-weight: 400;">Gage Growth (</span><a href="https://thecse.com/en/listings/life-sciences/gage-growth-corp-subordinate-voting-shares"><span style="font-weight: 400;">CSE:GAGE</span></a><span style="font-weight: 400;">)</span></li>
<li style="font-weight: 400;" aria-level="1"><span style="font-weight: 400;">Ayr Wellness (</span><a href="https://thecse.com/en/listings/life-sciences/ayr-wellness-inc-subordinate-voting-shares"><span style="font-weight: 400;">CSE:AYR.A</span></a><span style="font-weight: 400;">)</span></li>
<li style="font-weight: 400;" aria-level="1"><span style="font-weight: 400;">Red White &amp; Bloom Brands (</span><a href="https://www.thecse.com/en/listings/life-sciences/red-white-bloom-brands-inc"><span style="font-weight: 400;">CSE:RWB</span></a><span style="font-weight: 400;">)</span></li>
<li style="font-weight: 400;" aria-level="1"><span style="font-weight: 400;">4Front Ventures (</span><a href="https://thecse.com/en/listings/life-sciences/4front-ventures-corp"><span style="font-weight: 400;">CSE:FFNT</span></a><span style="font-weight: 400;">)</span></li>
</ul>
<p><span style="font-weight: 400;">Check out the Cannabis Issue of </span><i><span style="font-weight: 400;">Canadian Securities Exchange Magazin</span></i><span style="font-weight: 400;">e here:</span></p>
<div data-url="https://issuu.com/thecse/docs/cse-magazine-september-2021" style="width: 474px; height: 307px;" class="issuuembed"></div>
